WEBVTT

00:00:06.651 --> 00:00:13.293
Candy's heart was full of happiness
because of Anthony's kind heart.

00:00:19.857 --> 00:00:25.389
A small ribbon connecting hearts.

00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:40.230
Good morning, Caesar, Cleopatra.
I'll make you two pretty!

00:00:40.265 --> 00:00:42.240
You're up early, Candy!

00:00:42.322 --> 00:00:44.431
Good morning, Mr. Hoittman.

00:00:44.519 --> 00:00:46.652
Something good happened?

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:49.223
Can you tell?

00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:53.913
People wake up early and all by
themselves when they're happy.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.693
In that case, something good
happened to you, too?

00:00:56.819 --> 00:00:59.656
I woke up early because I'm the gardener.

00:00:59.691 --> 00:01:03.160
I always have to wake up this early
to work in the garden.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.871
But this time I want to see
our important guest.

00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:07.741
Guest?

00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:10.834
I think, mr. Brighton...

00:01:11.587 --> 00:01:14.348
Mr. Brighton?

00:01:14.404 --> 00:01:15.874
Something like that.

00:01:16.121 --> 00:01:20.886
Say, Mr. Hoittman, Mr. Brighton will
not be arriving alone?

00:01:20.921 --> 00:01:27.506
Dunno. Haven't seen him for years,
but probably, his daughter...

00:01:28.725 --> 00:01:31.784
Oh, I have a few things to do.

00:01:32.911 --> 00:01:37.075
Annie is coming. If mr. Brighton is
arriving, then Annie will come too.

00:01:38.011 --> 00:01:41.420
Kurin! Kurin!

00:01:42.847 --> 00:01:44.942
It's not because you overslept!

00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:47.728
Annie is coming!

00:01:49.179 --> 00:01:51.352
Annie from Pony's home!

00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:55.514
I thought I'd meet her someday,
but to meet her so soon...

00:01:56.202 --> 00:01:57.718
Annie.

00:02:02.022 --> 00:02:05.499
Ever since we were little,
I though of her as my sister.

00:02:07.369 --> 00:02:11.847
When she was taken away by Brightons,
I cried and cried.

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:15.170
I've never been as sad
as I was on that day.

00:02:18.284 --> 00:02:22.121
And Annie is coming now, Kurin!
Annie is coming!

00:02:26.577 --> 00:02:28.260
Did you call me?

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:34.403
What do you mean?

00:02:34.438 --> 00:02:36.238
Don't you know how you're
supposed to enter the room?

00:02:36.273 --> 00:02:37.948
Uh... you requested?

00:02:37.983 --> 00:02:41.799
Make horses more presentable.
Our guest will be riding one of them.

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.776
The guest will...?

00:02:43.811 --> 00:02:46.074
Her name is Annie Brighton, from...

00:02:46.243 --> 00:02:48.340
I'm right on it!

00:02:50.095 --> 00:02:51.351
What's up with her?

00:02:53.125 --> 00:02:57.016
Seems happy. She won't notice
what we've prepared for her.

00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:14.881
Well, well, isn't this Madam Brighton.

00:03:14.882 --> 00:03:15.941
Now, Annie.

00:03:15.976 --> 00:03:16.678
Yes.

00:03:21.911 --> 00:03:22.924
Annie!

00:03:24.507 --> 00:03:25.993
She is so pretty!

00:03:26.028 --> 00:03:27.852
She looks like a princess!

00:03:28.804 --> 00:03:34.353
My, my, you've become a fine lady.
So pretty.

00:03:36.423 --> 00:03:39.839
It's been such a long time,
madam Leagan!

00:03:39.874 --> 00:03:41.037
Really, it was.

00:03:42.991 --> 00:03:43.923
Candy.

00:03:47.402 --> 00:03:49.129
Farewell, Candy.

00:03:49.435 --> 00:03:52.255
I want to forget everything
about Pony's home.

00:03:52.758 --> 00:03:54.441
That's why I haven't sent
you any letters since then.

00:03:54.579 --> 00:03:56.475
Annie.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.865
Kurin, don't!

00:04:11.995 --> 00:04:13.110
Somebody!

00:04:17.738 --> 00:04:18.971
Kurin!

00:04:35.232 --> 00:04:37.055
-Candy!
-Yes!

00:04:37.254 --> 00:04:39.761
Don't do that, Kurin!
Welcome.

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:43.955
-Annie, are you okay?
-I'm sorry about this.

00:04:44.424 --> 00:04:49.307
Candy! What would you do if something
happened to our important guest?

00:04:49.342 --> 00:04:51.198
Yes, but Kurin was...

00:04:51.233 --> 00:04:53.066
Just take it away!

00:04:53.086 --> 00:04:54.679
Hold on, madam.

00:04:55.267 --> 00:04:58.487
Do you have a single room?

00:04:59.355 --> 00:05:01.752
She requires my constant attention.

00:05:01.787 --> 00:05:05.138
But madam, I'll make sure to scold
Candy because of this!

00:05:05.318 --> 00:05:08.498
No, there's no need to do that.

00:05:08.533 --> 00:05:09.884
Yes.

00:05:12.768 --> 00:05:15.799
I was so surprised to see you here!

00:05:15.834 --> 00:05:17.313
We haven't heard from each other
in a while.

00:05:17.348 --> 00:05:21.240
Candy, it was you that vexed
the raccoon upon Annie?

00:05:21.275 --> 00:05:22.462
Uh...

00:05:23.217 --> 00:05:27.796
I understand how you might feel, but
Annie is now a daughter of the Brightons.

00:05:30.107 --> 00:05:35.582
Suppose the Leagans find out that Annie
was living in Pony's home with you...

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.604
...the one who would suffer the most
would be Annie.

00:05:42.229 --> 00:05:47.377
Candy, if you really like Annie,
let this remain a secret.

00:05:50.023 --> 00:05:51.687
Okay? Understood?

00:05:57.716 --> 00:06:02.207
Anway, Neil and Eliza are happy
that you brought Annie along!

00:06:02.242 --> 00:06:04.096
Oh, really?

00:06:04.131 --> 00:06:08.184
Annie is the only daughter of
the Brighton family, am I right?

00:06:08.219 --> 00:06:10.333
Annie, aren't you feeling well?

00:06:10.483 --> 00:06:14.579
No, she's always like this.

00:06:15.668 --> 00:06:18.523
Maybe she could try to be a bit
more like Eliza.

00:06:18.558 --> 00:06:21.151
Oh, I'm just trying to look
like you, Mother!

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:26.296
Candy.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:32.883
Kurin, sometimes people shouldn't meet
each other, though they might want to.

00:06:34.869 --> 00:06:38.381
But it's okay. Later on, Annie
will come to the barn.

00:06:38.416 --> 00:06:40.466
And then... for sure.

00:06:49.967 --> 00:06:50.904
Neil!

00:06:53.993 --> 00:06:56.217
What are you doing here?

00:06:57.499 --> 00:06:58.918
Mind your own business!

00:06:59.177 --> 00:07:01.517
Aren't you hiding something?

00:07:01.917 --> 00:07:02.769
Shut up!

00:07:02.804 --> 00:07:06.649
Show me! If something happens in here,
it would be my fault!

00:07:07.363 --> 00:07:08.276
That's..!

00:07:11.914 --> 00:07:13.980
A broken spur?

00:07:14.015 --> 00:07:16.149
What were you doing with this piece
of junk?

00:07:16.184 --> 00:07:16.886
Give it!

00:07:23.188 --> 00:07:26.840
But... I've never rode a horse before!

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:29.536
It's okay! Right, brother?

00:07:29.571 --> 00:07:33.373
Yeah. Our Cleopatra is very calm.
Riding her is easy.

00:07:33.408 --> 00:07:34.525
I'm afraid!

00:07:35.339 --> 00:07:37.389
Annie, please ride the horse.

00:07:37.424 --> 00:07:40.316
That's right. A lady should
br fond of horse riding.

00:07:40.746 --> 00:07:42.558
Now, let's go!

00:07:42.593 --> 00:07:44.664
I'll borrow you my riding clothes.

00:07:46.428 --> 00:07:47.706
It's Annie!

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:51.464
Kurin, you mustn't bother Annie.

00:08:00.705 --> 00:08:04.048
Look, isn't she such a calm horse?

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:05.032
Yes.

00:08:08.681 --> 00:08:10.744
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:08:10.779 --> 00:08:12.652
Now, put your foot here.

00:08:15.683 --> 00:08:18.412
It's okay, put your foot here.

00:08:20.664 --> 00:08:22.628
Come on!

00:08:34.839 --> 00:08:37.846
Cleopatra, you need to be
very careful today!

00:08:37.957 --> 00:08:40.398
Candy.
I'm sorry.

00:08:41.428 --> 00:08:43.986
See! It's nothing to be afraid of!

00:08:44.366 --> 00:08:46.090
Okay, now look at this.

00:08:46.252 --> 00:08:48.472
It's so high up in the saddle, right?

00:08:48.744 --> 00:08:50.530
It'll be okay if you hang on tightly.

00:08:51.185 --> 00:08:53.359
What's the matter?

00:08:53.995 --> 00:08:55.212
Neil!

00:09:03.282 --> 00:09:06.060
Annie! Don't let go!

00:09:06.986 --> 00:09:09.049
Candy!

00:09:12.719 --> 00:09:15.177
Candy, help me!

00:09:15.352 --> 00:09:17.511
Annie! Hold on!

00:09:17.571 --> 00:09:19.719
Candy!

00:09:33.914 --> 00:09:36.106
What? A girl was riding that horse?

00:09:36.815 --> 00:09:38.503
Get away! Another one!

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:43.511
A girl was riding this one, too?
What's up with that?

00:09:45.171 --> 00:09:48.275
Annie, hang in there.
I'm coming now.

00:09:48.822 --> 00:09:52.931
As soon as Annie climbed on the horse,
Candy scratched its rear with this.

00:09:53.349 --> 00:09:54.735
Right, Eliza?

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.727
Yes, that's right.
And we couldn't stop her.

00:09:58.028 --> 00:10:03.974
Madam, I failed to keep my eyes on Candy.
This wouldn't have happened otherwise.

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:08.537
That's right, it was all Candy's doing!
Right, brother?

00:10:08.937 --> 00:10:11.585
That's right. She quickly becomes
violent if you don't keep an eye on her.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.772
Annie.. if something happens to her...

00:10:15.095 --> 00:10:19.064
Annie... I must help her somehow!

00:10:22.339 --> 00:10:26.215
Help me!

00:10:27.328 --> 00:10:29.659
Annie, hang in there!

00:10:32.868 --> 00:10:35.629
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
I think this episode takes place during
the summer of 1911. Then again, I'm retarded.

00:10:40.358 --> 00:10:43.917
Annie, I'm coming now! Hang in there!

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.366
Stop! Cleopatra, stop!

00:11:10.931 --> 00:11:12.652
Stop, Cleopatra!

00:11:16.804 --> 00:11:18.980
Be a good girl, Cleopatra!

00:11:19.015 --> 00:11:20.491
Stop.

00:11:25.836 --> 00:11:28.570
Good girl. Calm down.

00:11:29.393 --> 00:11:33.666
Annie? Annie, it's okay now!
You're scared, aren't you?

00:11:35.567 --> 00:11:37.151
Candy.

00:11:37.661 --> 00:11:40.042
You're okay, thank god.

00:11:45.806 --> 00:11:48.116
What a horrible thing to do.

00:11:48.412 --> 00:11:51.019
Neil will hear from me
when we come back!

00:11:51.577 --> 00:11:53.553
Annie, why are you so quiet?

00:11:53.929 --> 00:11:56.693
You haven't said a thing
all day long.

00:11:58.328 --> 00:12:00.527
It's okay, nobody is watching.

00:12:00.562 --> 00:12:03.458
Are you pretending not to know
me in front of everybody?

00:12:05.743 --> 00:12:09.625
Annie, haven't we seen each
other in a while?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.747
You know, Sister Lane and
John came the other day.

00:12:11.748 --> 00:12:12.509
John!

00:12:20.408 --> 00:12:23.895
Please... stop telling me
about Pony's home.

00:12:24.045 --> 00:12:25.349
Annie?

00:12:25.398 --> 00:12:28.364
I forgot everybody.

00:12:28.531 --> 00:12:29.603
Annie.

00:12:30.353 --> 00:12:31.806
Forgive me, Candy.

00:12:31.841 --> 00:12:33.766
Don't make me go through
this anymore.

00:12:33.801 --> 00:12:36.045
I had to forget everything.

00:12:36.167 --> 00:12:42.459
Annie, you've forgotten about sister Pony,
sister Lane, me and everybody else?

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.414
I didn't want to! I had to!

00:12:49.588 --> 00:12:51.770
I'm a daughter of the Brightons.

00:12:52.284 --> 00:12:55.156
I have to do this in order to
protect my happiness.

00:12:57.027 --> 00:13:00.384
As mother was always saying;

00:13:01.108 --> 00:13:08.505
Annie, we took you because you're a wonderful
girl, and you'll be happy once you become one of us.

00:13:08.961 --> 00:13:10.642
I'm worried about one thing, however.

00:13:10.677 --> 00:13:18.785
If someone learns of your past in Pony's home,
you won't be able to make your way in high society.

00:13:22.753 --> 00:13:24.277
I dunno.

00:13:24.899 --> 00:13:29.640
What does it matter to the society if
you don't have a mother or a father?

00:13:29.675 --> 00:13:31.718
Don't say anything else, Candy!

00:13:32.098 --> 00:13:35.326
I can't help it. Not anymore.

00:13:35.633 --> 00:13:39.782
Kurin... they wouldn't even
let me see Kurin!

00:13:40.408 --> 00:13:44.725
He looked forward so much to meet me...
He was so happy to see me!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.636
I wasn't even able to show my grief!

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:52.506
Miss Annie!

00:13:54.772 --> 00:13:56.381
It's the car from the estate.

00:13:56.839 --> 00:14:01.194
-Miss Annie, are you alright?
-Good thing that you're not hurt.

00:14:01.229 --> 00:14:03.242
Don't worry, she was only scared a little.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.825
Candy, madam is angry and wants
to see you!

00:14:10.169 --> 00:14:11.757
Why me?

00:14:12.739 --> 00:14:17.087
Candy. Are you saying that it was Neil's
fault that the horse went on a rampage?

00:14:17.122 --> 00:14:20.971
That's right. Neil scratched Cleopatra's
rear with a broken spur and...

00:14:21.006 --> 00:14:24.806
That's enough! Are you trying to
accuse others of your own doing?

00:14:24.841 --> 00:14:28.696
That's exactly what Neil was doing!
Please, call Neil!

00:14:29.372 --> 00:14:32.439
You've got some nerve for a servant!

00:14:32.474 --> 00:14:34.507
I'll bring him myself then!

00:14:34.542 --> 00:14:36.568
Stop right there!
Candy!

00:14:41.232 --> 00:14:42.881
What's up with that face?

00:14:42.916 --> 00:14:44.777
And you call yourself a man?

00:14:44.812 --> 00:14:45.946
What are you doing?

00:14:45.947 --> 00:14:49.667
I'm not angry because you tried
to tack your crime onto me!

00:14:49.702 --> 00:14:51.514
It hurts! Let me go!

00:14:51.684 --> 00:14:55.891
If I hadn't catched up to her, she would've
fallen off and would've been hurt badly!

00:14:56.181 --> 00:15:00.401
What's this, how come you are
worried so much about Annie?

00:15:00.783 --> 00:15:02.400
Annie is...!

00:15:02.739 --> 00:15:04.602
Annie? What's up with her?

00:15:05.558 --> 00:15:08.590
Miss Annie is a very important guest!

00:15:08.625 --> 00:15:10.933
Don't you ever approach her again if
you'll do something like that again!

00:15:10.968 --> 00:15:12.878
Who are you to tell me what to do?

00:15:12.913 --> 00:15:14.396
Why, you!

00:15:14.431 --> 00:15:16.031
Stop that!

00:15:16.066 --> 00:15:19.621
Neil, if you do something to Annie
again, I won't forgive you!

00:15:19.656 --> 00:15:22.771
It hurts!
Mother!

00:15:23.676 --> 00:15:25.117
What's this!

00:15:25.152 --> 00:15:27.749
-Stewart! Quickly, get Neal...
-Yes, madam.

00:15:27.791 --> 00:15:29.812
Candy, don't do that!

00:15:33.701 --> 00:15:35.823
Neil, that's a promise!

00:15:36.245 --> 00:15:37.738
I understand.

00:15:38.261 --> 00:15:41.693
Candy, we will have you expelled
from this household.

00:15:41.728 --> 00:15:44.738
I don't remember you mentioning
anything about that.

00:15:45.541 --> 00:15:48.056
There are plenty of servants
that can replace you.

00:15:48.189 --> 00:15:49.354
But...!

00:15:50.047 --> 00:15:53.001
I'm sure I heard that from Annie, as well.

00:15:55.345 --> 00:15:56.327
Why?

00:15:57.576 --> 00:15:59.940
I'm supposed to...

00:16:06.793 --> 00:16:07.837
Annie?

00:16:08.517 --> 00:16:09.790
But...!

00:16:10.209 --> 00:16:12.735
It wasn't Neil's fault, wasn't it?

00:16:15.689 --> 00:16:17.203
Well, Annie?

00:16:17.238 --> 00:16:18.323
I...

00:16:18.567 --> 00:16:20.421
She will...

00:16:20.456 --> 00:16:21.815
Quickly, say it!

00:16:22.144 --> 00:16:23.496
Uh...

00:16:25.906 --> 00:16:28.098
Annie, what's the matter?

00:16:28.863 --> 00:16:30.332
Mother!

00:16:31.878 --> 00:16:36.296
Madam, can we somehow bring this
issue to an end?

00:16:36.331 --> 00:16:39.609
It was most fortunate that
Annie was not hurt in the accident.

00:16:40.314 --> 00:16:45.130
I don't think so. Candy put our
important guest in great danger.

00:16:45.272 --> 00:16:47.993
But wasn't Candy the one who
stopped the horse?

00:16:48.028 --> 00:16:49.434
But, madam...

00:16:49.521 --> 00:16:55.122
We'll do it this way, then. If Candy
apologizes, we'll call this over.

00:16:55.239 --> 00:16:57.362
If that's what madam wants...

00:16:57.397 --> 00:16:59.125
Well then, Candy?

00:16:59.726 --> 00:17:01.606
Why do I have to...

00:17:08.361 --> 00:17:12.106
Okay? Next time we meet,
it's your birthday.

00:17:12.141 --> 00:17:15.459
If I leave this house now,
I'll never see Anthony again.

00:17:15.939 --> 00:17:18.594
And I'll get sister Pony
and sister Lane very worried.

00:17:19.895 --> 00:17:21.738
Okay, Candy?

00:17:22.003 --> 00:17:25.604
You won't get her to apologize
so easily, she's not obedient!

00:17:26.003 --> 00:17:28.258
Yes. But it's a compromise.

00:17:32.647 --> 00:17:33.746
I'm sorry.

00:17:44.743 --> 00:17:47.360
It is.. It is alright.

00:17:47.708 --> 00:17:49.483
What does it matter if I
apologized to her?

00:17:49.518 --> 00:17:51.723
I know it was hard on her, too.

00:18:00.056 --> 00:18:01.725
Candy.

00:18:09.768 --> 00:18:11.048
It's alright, Kurin.

00:18:11.083 --> 00:18:15.510
Annie is going back where
we can't reach her.

00:18:19.348 --> 00:18:21.775
Come see us again.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.858
Yes, certainly.
We've had a pleasant time.

00:18:24.893 --> 00:18:26.335
Well then,
till next time.

00:18:29.395 --> 00:18:30.945
Annie is going back!

00:18:35.368 --> 00:18:38.154
Candy, I'm sorry.

00:18:46.255 --> 00:18:51.090
Annie, farewell.
Take care of yourself.

00:18:56.168 --> 00:18:57.538
Candy.

00:18:58.746 --> 00:19:02.323
It was hard on you, wasn't it, Candy?

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:08.215
I came to apologize to you.

00:19:10.151 --> 00:19:12.263
I saw everything.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.382
Everybody was telling lies,
but these eyes saw it all.

00:19:16.775 --> 00:19:21.747
But I let you down as a friend.
I was too afraid to defend you.

00:19:21.782 --> 00:19:24.872
Gardeners like me aren't supposed
to be curious.

00:19:26.142 --> 00:19:31.264
It's okay, mr. Hoittman.
I wasn't crying because of that.

00:19:32.821 --> 00:19:38.267
Today I lost someone who was
like a sister to me.

00:19:39.253 --> 00:19:41.439
It's Annie, right?

00:19:43.551 --> 00:19:46.845
No. Annie is still your friend!

00:19:48.445 --> 00:19:52.995
In that moment, when she was about to fall
off the horse, just what was she saying?

00:19:53.427 --> 00:19:55.085
Candy!

00:19:56.236 --> 00:19:58.113
Candy!

00:19:58.148 --> 00:19:59.740
Annie was calling my name!

00:20:00.569 --> 00:20:06.004
That's right. Not her mother or father.
Instead she called your name.

00:20:07.887 --> 00:20:12.486
In such times, people call out the
people whom they like the most.

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:14.292
Annie?

00:20:21.697 --> 00:20:22.993
Annie!

00:20:36.268 --> 00:20:39.162
Ribbon.
It's Annie's ribbon.

00:20:40.583 --> 00:20:43.268
She must have left it behind on purpose.

00:20:45.336 --> 00:20:47.798
Just like mr. Hoittman said.

00:20:51.484 --> 00:20:55.057
Annie!
We'll be friends forever, right?

00:20:56.204 --> 00:21:02.566
That small ribbon connected Candy
and Annie's hearts together again.

00:21:03.435 --> 00:21:11.375
Even though bad things do happen,
a greater good might come out of it.

00:21:14.703 --> 00:21:20.030
To be continued...
